<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">

<head>
    <meta charset="utf-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
    <title>FizzBuzz - jqyml</title>
    <link rel="icon" href="/favicon.ico" type="image/x-icon">
    <meta name="description" content="FizzBuzz in jq: 1 to n, Fizz/Buzz/FizzBuzz.">
    <style>
        * { box-sizing: border-box; }
        body { font-family: system-ui, sans-serif; max-width: 42rem; margin: 2rem auto; padding: 0 1rem; color: #1a1a1a; background: #f8f8f8; }
        header { display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 1rem; margin-bottom: 1.5rem; padding-bottom: 1rem; border-bottom: 1px solid #ddd; }
        .header-left { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.75rem; }
        .header-left h1 { margin: 0; font-size: 1.25rem; }
        .header-left a { font-size: 0.875rem; }
        .counter-box { padding: 0.5rem 0; font-size: 0.875rem; }
        .counter-box .count { font-weight: 600; }
        h1 { font-size: 1.5rem; font-weight: 600; margin-bottom: 0.5rem; }
        h2 { font-size: 1.15rem; margin-top: 1.5rem; margin-bottom: 0.5rem; }
        p { color: #555; margin-bottom: 1rem; line-height: 1.5; }
        pre, code { font-family: ui-monospace, monospace; font-size: 0.75rem; line-height: 1.3; background: #1a1a1a; color: #e0e0e0; border-radius: 6px; }
        pre { padding: 1rem; overflow: auto; margin: 0.5rem 0 1rem; white-space: pre; }
        code { padding: 0.2em 0.4em; }
        pre code { padding: 0; background: none; }
        a { color: #333; text-decoration: underline; }
        a:hover { color: #555; }
        form { display: flex; align-items: baseline; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 0.5rem 1rem; margin-bottom: 1rem; }
        label { font-size: 0.875rem; font-weight: 500; }
        input[type="number"] { width: 5rem; padding: 0.35rem 0.5rem; font-size: 0.875rem; border: 1px solid #ccc; border-radius: 6px; }
        button { padding: 0.5rem 1rem; font-size: 0.875rem; font-weight: 500; color: #fff; background: #333; border: none; border-radius: 6px; cursor: pointer; }
        button:hover { background: #555; }
    </style>
</head>

<body>
    <header>
        <div class="header-left">
            <h1><a href="/" style="text-decoration: none; color: inherit;">jqyml</a></h1>
            <a href="/rule110">Rule 110</a>
            <a href="/fizzbuzz">FizzBuzz</a>
            <a href="/built_with">Built with</a>
        </div>
        <div class="counter-box">Visitor count: <span id="count" class="count">{counter_html}</span></div>
    </header>

    <h1>FizzBuzz</h1>
    <p>Classic FizzBuzz: for 1 to <em>n</em>, print the number, or "Fizz" (multiples of 3), "Buzz" (multiples of 5), or "FizzBuzz" (multiples of 15). This page runs it in <strong>jq</strong>.</p>

    <form method="get" action="/fizzbuzz">
        <label for="n">Up to (1–500):</label>
        <input type="number" id="n" name="n" min="1" max="500" value="{n_display}" placeholder="30">
        <button type="submit">Run</button>
    </form>

    <h2>Code</h2>
    <pre><code>{code_snippet}</code></pre>

    {output_block}
</body>

</html>
